  on top of that not only did i say it but  plenty of others did as well if you go  back to last year paul tudor jones said  i think that i'm going to need inflation  hedge assets i want to be with the  fastest horse be with bitcoin and so  when that cpi print came out at 6.2  percent guess what bitcoin did it took  off like a rocket ship and hit 69 000  which is a brand new all-time high for  the digital currency this is what ends  up happening when you continue to have  undisciplined monetary and fiscal policy  you drive all  assets up whether they are consumable  goods things like food or used cars or  other types of assets like that  or we are talking about investment  assets where you see the stock market  you see every commodity you see bitcoin  and you see real estate all exploding in  price the currency is being devalued at  a historic rate it has not devalued at  this rate for 30 years  30 years we have not seen this  and so anyone who's telling you don't  worry about it maybe we should stop  worrying what they say and we should  actually start paying attention and  asking ourselves what can i do to  protect myself because i don't see any  relief on the horizon

